variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320803009:1":{"text":"いいや！山羊ミルクが嫌いな奴は知ってるけどな。","source_cn":"没有！我倒是见过不爱喝羊奶的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A3219A024162F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320803010:1":{"text":"本当ですよ！フーキンさんって言う方なんですけど。彼は新しい物を発明するのが好きで、規則に縛られたり、ただ同じことを繰り返すような人ではありません！","source_cn":"是真的呢，他叫呼金！他最喜欢做的事就是不断发明新东西，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCA49D479E16C614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320803011:1":{"text":"え？フーキンって言ったか？","source_cn":"等等……呼金？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD5D79EBD5A3DBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320803012:1":{"text":"フーキンって、あの「企画師」フーキン？","source_cn":"你说那个呼金？“规划师”呼金？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1E22AD4ACBF89CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320803013:1":{"text":"はっ！そんなバカな！そもそもこの企画書を作ったのが彼なんだぞ！","source_cn":"哈，这绝不可能！因为这个计划就是他制定的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7CF79A9A901CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1320803013":{"text":"はっ！そんなバカな！そもそもこの企画書を作ったのが彼なんだぞ！","source_cn":"哈，这绝不可能！因为这个计划就是他制定的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7CF79A9A901CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320803014:1":{"text":"当然だ。上級技師から見習いまで、ここで彼を知らない者はいない。俺たちの居住区の改修設計図だって、彼自ら書いてくれたんだ。","source_cn":"当然，从高级工程师到这里的学徒都知道他。他还亲自给我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x746E110C6F406B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320803015:1":{"text":"つまり、あのフーキンさんが……この恐ろしく詳しい工程を書いたということですか？","source_cn":"唔，你们说，这一整套足可以吓死人的流程……是呼金制定的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA01CAFDAEFCA4373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320803016:1":{"text":"そうだ。俺たちは嘘はつかん！","source_cn":"当然，我们从不说谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F853EC6A6C2260E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320803017:1":{"text":"えっと、じゃあ……作業は一時中止して、フーキンさんに聞いてみましょうよ。","source_cn":"你们……你们先不要动，就当停工，我们去找呼金问个清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B0075027050456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl